@startuml
title The life of an order
[*] --> Cart
Cart --> Cart : add a product
Cart --> Paid : pay
Cart --> [*] : leave
Paid --> Shipped : ship
Paid --> Refunded : cancel
Shipped --> Delivered : deliver
Shipped --> Returned : refuse
Returned --> Refunded : check the goods
Delivered --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]
@enduml
